 <text>
  <body>
   <p><date when="1860-12-18">18</date> 
<lb/>The <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">Governor</persName> accepted and caused to be filed the resignation of <persName ref="cwgk:N00021509">H. C. Anderson</persName> Second Lieutenant in the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000916">"National Blues"</orgName> of <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000337">Louisville</placeName></p>
<p>He respited for twelve months a Judgment of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000422">Madison Circuit Court</orgName> against <persName ref="cwgk:N00021530">M Turpin</persName> for gaming.</p>
<p>He remitted the following Judgments, to wit:</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000479">Nelson Cir. Ct.</orgName> vs. <persName ref="cwgk:N00021533">W. W. Cadworth</persName> -- </cell>
	<cell>$100. -- </cell>
	<cell>Lottery.</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000422">Madison " " "</orgName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00021511">Tho. Shiflett</persName></cell>
	<cell>$60.</cell>
	<cell>Tipling</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>Do " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021528">R. I. Pond</persName></cell>
	<cell>$20.</cell>
	<cell>Gaming</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000378">Floyd " " "</orgName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00021510">Geo W. Lewis</persName></cell>
	<cell>$100.</cell>
	<cell>Forfeited Recognizance</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000585">Warren " " "</orgName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00021527">Cyrus Mack</persName></cell>
	<cell>$60.</cell>
	<cell>Tipling</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000582">Union " " "</orgName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00021532">L Tusinger</persName></cell>
	<cell>$60</cell>
	<cell>"</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000409">Johnson " " "</orgName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00021531">N. Preston</persName></cell>
	<cell>$60.</cell>
	<cell>"</cell>
</row>
</table></p>
